# REQUIRES: kitfc
#
# FIXME: Support to lower DO loops using tapir instructions has not been
# implemented yet.
# XFAIL: *
#
# Check a standard "end-to-end" lowering using LTO. We emit LLVM from LLD
# because running the linker may not work on systems with non-standard
# sysroots.
#
# RUN: %kitfc -ftapir=hip -O2 -flto -Wl,--lto-emit-llvm -o - \
# RUN:     %S/../input/add.f90 %S/../input/main.f90 2>&1 \
# RUN:     | opt -S
# RUN:     | FileCheck %s
#
# CHECK: call {{.+}} @__kithip_launch_kernel